    },
    {
      "note": "The `license` field above is Apache-2.0, which covers this project's code, but the repository is not single-licensed. It redistributes third-party scientific data that keeps its own terms: CC BY 4.0 (UniProt, AlphaFold DB), CC BY-SA 3.0 (ChEMBL-derived files -- SHARE-ALIKE, so reuse carries an obligation onward), CC0 1.0 (RCSB depositions) and MIT (Boltz-2 model outputs). NOTICE lists which files fall under which.",
